{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0413_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "21b999adf11ae3f1b5d6e3d06ddba6c528fb89eb0e234636967a34eacf82df7a", "ja": "あっ、すみません！\n自分たちの映像なのに、つい見入っちゃって……。", "zh": "啊，对不起！\n明明是我们自己的影像，却不知不觉看入迷了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0413_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "297bb15bb65ccbfa8aa727cee94976afc010726ad23367981cbb22d4405d6def", "ja": "でも本当にいい感じですね！\nみんな綺麗で、すごくキラキラしてます！", "zh": "不过真的很棒呢！\n大家都好漂亮，闪闪发光的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
