{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0413_1007_401pro", "source_sha256": "75577e44fe5b466079d9ed6df5f09e167045ab2f12572380cd0558fd75cb41fc", "ja": "改めてお疲れさま、美奈子。先頭に立って、\nチームを引っ張るのも大変だっただろう。", "zh": "再次辛苦你了，美奈子。站在最前面带领团队，一定很不容易吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
