{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0413_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "e166eea4cd1cd9a4b10b2757f413b2a1117ae120ae72ee3835d501b71d1cbcc3", "ja": "ただ、みんなと一緒だから頑張れただけですよ。\n一番星を目指す、仲間だから。", "zh": "只是因为和大家在一起，我才能努力到现在。\n因为我们是以摘下第一颗星为目标的伙伴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
